       engine + generic vanilla-style default marks as EXAMPLES; the nine
       campaign mark-styles move to Salvation (RUT tier) separately. These
       three are vanilla RimWorld register - weathered wear, a practical
       tally, a hazard sign - zero franchise/campaign vocabulary. Same
       shape as RM_Graffiti_Vandal: ParentName="RM_BaseGraffiti",
       Graphic_Random over a texPath folder, CornerFiller linked to Wall.
       Art generated per the generating-rimworld-sprites skill (native-
       alpha $imagegen, conformed onto a 640x640 canvas to match
       RM_Graffiti_Vandal's own canvas), not copied from any donor mod. -->

